# ABP FluentValidation Integration

## Setup
Install `Volo.Abp.FluentValidation` package and add module dependency:

```csharp
[DependsOn(typeof(AbpFluentValidationModule))]
public class MyModule : AbpModule { }
```

## Creating Validators
```csharp
public class CreateBookDtoValidator : AbstractValidator<CreateBookDto>
{
    public CreateBookDtoValidator()
    {
        RuleFor(x => x.Name).NotEmpty().Length(3, 100);
        RuleFor(x => x.Price).GreaterThan(0).LessThan(1000);
        RuleFor(x => x.PublishDate).LessThanOrEqualTo(DateTime.Now);
    }
}
```

ABP automatically discovers and applies validators to DTOs during validation.
